# Adapted from the public-domain Alice exchange in the Recite README.
# Keep this comment and every existing ID when editing the dialogue.
:: which_way default

> speaker=alice @alice_way_001
  Would you tell me, please, which way I ought to go from here?

> speaker=cheshire_cat portrait=grin @cat_way_001
  That depends a good deal on where you want to get to.

? @answer_anywhere
  I don't much care where.
  -> anywhere

? @ffee6p8
  I would like to see the garden.
  -> garden

:: anywhere
> speaker=cheshire_cat @cat_anywhere_001
  Then it doesn't matter which way you go.
-> END

:: garden
> speaker=alice @rthh7ab
  Then I shall try that way.
-> END
